{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Util/Incremental.html#Batteries.Tactic.simpleIncrementalElab\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">simpleIncrementalElab</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">cmd</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Command.html#Lean.Elab.Command.CommandElab\">Lean.Elab.Command.CommandElab</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Command.html#Lean.Elab.Command.CommandElab\">Lean.Elab.Command.CommandElab</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Wraps `cmd` with simple incrementality handling that makes the command not re-run if only trailing\nwhitespace was changed or when a syntax error gets introduced and then removed again.\n\nTo make this work, `cmd` doesn't receive the trailing whitespace of the command and doesn't have\naccess to incrementality itself.\n\nTo make use of this, you have to write an explicit elaborator (i.e. a declaration with a\n`@[command_elab]`) and tag it with `@[incremental]` and then wrap the body in\n`simpleIncrementalElab`. Example:\n```\nsyntax (name := expensiveCmd) \"#expensive_command\" : command\n\n@[command_elab expensiveCmd, incremental]\ndef elabExpensiveCmd : CommandElab := simpleIncrementalElab fun stx => do\n  ...\n```","docLink":"./Batteries/Util/Incremental.html#Batteries.Tactic.simpleIncrementalElab","kind":"def","line":51,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.simpleIncrementalElab","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/8bde0b1a1589dfc5888a3c9d5f1185fb75399cb2/Batteries/Util/Incremental.lean#L51-L132"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Util/Incremental.html#Batteries.Tactic.instToSnapshotTreeSimpleIncrementalSnapshot\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">instToSnapshotTreeSimpleIncrementalSnapshot</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Language/Basic.html#Lean.Language.ToSnapshotTree\">Lean.Language.ToSnapshotTree</a> <a href=\"./Batteries/Util/Incremental.html#Batteries.Tactic.SimpleIncrementalSnapshot\">SimpleIncrementalSnapshot</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Batteries/Util/Incremental.html#Batteries.Tactic.instToSnapshotTreeSimpleIncrementalSnapshot","kind":"instance","line":44,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.instToSnapshotTreeSimpleIncrementalSnapshot","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/8bde0b1a1589dfc5888a3c9d5f1185fb75399cb2/Batteries/Util/Incremental.lean#L44-L49"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Util/Incremental.html#Batteries.Tactic.instToSnapshotTreeCommandElabResultSnapshot\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">instToSnapshotTreeCommandElabResultSnapshot</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Language/Basic.html#Lean.Language.ToSnapshotTree\">Lean.Language.ToSnapshotTree</a> <a href=\"./Batteries/Util/Incremental.html#Batteries.Tactic.CommandElabResultSnapshot\">CommandElabResultSnapshot</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Batteries/Util/Incremental.html#Batteries.Tactic.instToSnapshotTreeCommandElabResultSnapshot","kind":"instance","line":40,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.instToSnapshotTreeCommandElabResultSnapshot","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/8bde0b1a1589dfc5888a3c9d5f1185fb75399cb2/Batteries/Util/Incremental.lean#L40-L42"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span cla